-and-family/block-03-my-home/lsg/gb-street.lsg"},{"text":"","sound":"Hey, Dhroov! You live nearby, right?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Hello! Yeah, I live just around the corner.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m3_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/dhruv.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Cool! What’s your home like?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"It’s nice! Let me tell you a bit about it. In the living room, we have a sofa and a TV. There’s also a big, fluffy rug on the floor.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m3_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/dhruv.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Sounds cosy! What about the kitchen?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"In the kitchen, there’s a fridge and an oven. We also have a big table where we have breakfast together every morning.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m3_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/dhruv.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Do you have your own bedroom?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Yes, I do. In my bedroom, there’s a bed, a chair and a lamp that I really like.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m3_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/dhruv.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Do you have your own bathroom, too?","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"No, I share a bathroom with my brother. It’s small, but it has a toilet, a sink and a shower in it.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m3_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/dhruv.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Nice! Your home sounds really comfortable.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"f2_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/mei.lsg"}},{"button":"Continue"},{"text":"","sound":"Thanks! I like it a lot.","speaker":true,"autoplay":true,"voice":"m3_chirp","person":{"lsg":"/../c-eng-2-gb/shared/students/dhruv.lsg"}}]},{"trainer":"gap","onSamePage":true,"gapMode":"write","instruction":{"text":"Read and write."},"soundMode":"a","textAlign":"left","uniqueSolutions":true,"atoms":[{"a":"What furniture is in Dhruv’s living room?","sound":"What furniture is in Dhroov’s living room?","b":"In the living room, there is a ((sofa TV rug)), a ((sofa TV rug)) and a ((sofa TV rug))."},{"a":"What’s in the kitchen?","b":"In the kitchen, there’s an oven, a ((fridge table)) and a ((fridge table))."},{"a":"What’s in his bedroom?","b":"In Dhruv’s bedroom, there is a ((bed lamp chair)), a ((bed lamp chair)) and a ((bed lamp chair))."},{"a":"What’s in the bathroom?","b":"In the bathroom, there is a ((sink toilet shower)), a ((sink toilet shower)) and a ((sink toilet shower))."}]}],"parentTopic":{"title":"Home and Family","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-04-home-and-family/topic","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/tcuq53"},"parentBlock":{"title":"My Home","path":"/../c-eng-2-gb/topic-04-home-and-family/block-03-my-home/block","puid":"c-eng-2-gb/td9np2"},"mediaFiles":{"sounds":[{"fileId":"sound/en/f2_chirp/Cool! What’s your home like?","etag":"d964-7828"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2_chirp/Do you have your own bathroom, too?","etag":"b5dc-7957"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2_chirp/Do you have your own bedroom?","etag":"58fe-6579"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2_chirp/Hey, Dhroov! You live nearby, right?","etag":"e7f8-10014"},{"fileId":"sound/en/f2_chirp/Nice! Your home sounds r